<fw type="catch" place="bottom">50. Matt</fw><lb/>
<pb facs="#f0180"/>
<lg n="50"> <head><hi rendition="#c">50.</hi></head><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#in">M</hi>att wie &#x017F;ie war, er&#x017F;cho&#x0364;pfte die&#x017F;e mu&#x0364;h</l><lb/>
