<fw type="catch" place="bottom">53. So</fw><lb/>
<pb facs="#f0181"/>
<lg n="53"> <head><hi rendition="#c">53.</hi></head><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#in">S</hi>o la&#x0364;ßt &#x017F;ich un&#x017F;rer noth der Himmel doch erbarmen,</l><lb/>
